# What vsce leaves out of claude-toolbar.vsix: everything except the compiled extension in dist\. vsce adds
# package.json and README.md to every package itself. vsce reads this file by default (VS Code's "Publishing
# Extensions" page documents it) and refuses a "files" field in package.json beside it.
# tests\package.integration.test.ts checks what goes in: one dist\ .js per src\ .ts, package.json, README.md.
**
!dist/**
